it\u00e9s sont gratuites et disponibles dans les 24 langues de l'Union europ\u00e9enne. ","description_print":"D\u00e9couvrez le coeur de la d\u00e9mocratie europ\u00e9enne qui repr\u00e9sente plus de 500 millions de citoyens \u00e0 travers l'Union europ\u00e9enne. Le Parlement europ\u00e9en \u00e0 Bruxelles offre une experience unique aux visiteurs de tout \u00e2ge et de tous horizons. Toutes les activit\u00e9s sont gratuites et disponibles dans les 24 langues de l'Union europ\u00e9enne. ","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Europees Parlement","address_street_name":"Luxemburgplein","address_street_number":"100","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.europarl.europa.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1047","address_city":"Europees Parlement","address_line1":"Luxemburgplein, 100","address_line2":"1047 Europees Parlement","description_web":"Ontdek het kloppende hart van de Europese democratie, dat meer dan 500 miljoen burgers uit alle hoeken van de Europese Unie vertegenwoordigt. Bezoekers van alle leeftijden en achtergronden kunnen in het Europees Parlement in Brussel terecht voor een unieke ervaring. Alle activiteiten zijn er gratis en beschikbaar in de 24 EU-talen. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"European Parliament","address_street_name":"Place du Luxembourg","address_street_number":"100","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.europarl.europa.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1047","address_city":"Parlement Europ\u00e9en","address_line1":"Place du Luxembourg, 100","address_line2":"1047 Parlement Europ\u00e9en","description_web":"Discover the beating heart of European democracy, responsible for over 500 million citizens across the European Union. The European Parliament in Brussels offers a unique experience for visitors of all ages and backgrounds. All activities