el","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles, in wat ooit een overdekte markthal was pal in het midden van \u00e9\u00e9n van de meest geanimeerde pleinen van Brussel (Sint-Goriks), is een caf\u00e9 met in de gewelfde kelders een club waar regelmatig goede feestjes gebouwd worden. Boven is het gezellig keuvelen in de lederen zetels. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cafedeshalles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cafedeshalles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 33 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles is located in a fully renovated ancient covered market place at the very lively Place Saint-G\u00e9ry. You can chill and chat in the black leather chairs, and party in the club in the vaulted cellars.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 des Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cafedeshalles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cafedeshalles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 33 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Caf\u00e9 Des Halles ist ein sch\u00f6nes Caf\u00e9 in dem ehemaligen pr\u00e4chtigen Marktgeb\u00e4ude an einer der belebtesten Pl\u00e4tze Br\u00fcssels. Das komplett renovierte Geb\u00e4ude bietet Raum f\u00fcr mehrere gem\u00fctliche Ecken, in denen Ledersessel zum Verweilen einladen. In den Kellergew\u00f6lben befindet sich ein Club, in dem regelm\u00e4\u00df