"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[528941],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,261,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-08-04T01:35:42+02:00","published_at":"2022-03-17T10:50:28+01:00","backoffice_id":249843,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.2297111188609},{"id":529872,"date_start":"2022-02-27","date_end":"2022-08-14","date_next":"2022-08-14","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Family Fundays","shortdescr":"En famille, apprenez avec les guides \u00e0 regarder les oeuvres, \u00e0 r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir et \u00e0 examiner les th\u00e9matiques qu'elles \u00e9voquent.","longdescr":"Chaque 1e et 3e dimanche du mois, un.e guide du WIELS emm\u00e8ne les enfants et leurs parents en balade \u00e0 travers une des nouvelles expositions. Apprenez \u00e0 regarder les \u0153uvres d'art ensemble, \u00e0 en parler et \u00e0 y r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir. Profitez d'une journ\u00e9e agr\u00e9able et cr\u00e9ative pour toute la famille !\r\n\r\nBilingue (FR\/NL)\r\nInclus dans le ticket (gratuit pour les -18 ans)\r\nEnfants entre 2 et 12 ans","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wiels.org\/fr\/events\/family-funday-22","email":"kets@wiels.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 340 00 53","phone_booking":"+32 2 340 00 53","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/529872.html"},"nl":{"name":"Family Fundays","shortdescr":"Leer samen met de tweetalige gidsen en je gezin naar kunstwerken kijken en beleef de thema's van de tentoonstellingen door in dialoog te gaan met elkaar en met het werk.","longdescr":"Elke 1e en 3e zondag van de maand, neemt een WIELS-gids kinderen en hun ouders mee op sleeptouw door een van de tentoonstellingen. Leer samen met de tweetalige gidsen en je gezin naar kunstwerken kijken en beleef de thema's van de tentoonstellingen door in dialoog te gaan met elkaar en met het werk. Geniet van een fijne en creatieve dag voor het hele gezin!\r\n\r\nTweetalig FR\/NL\r\nInbegrepen in het tentoonstellingsticket (gratis voor kinderen)\r\nKinderen tussen 2 en 12 jaar oud","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wiels.org\/nl\/events\/family-funday-22","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/529872.html"},"en":{"name":"Family Fundays","shortdescr":"Learn to look at works of art together with our bilingual guides and your family, and experience the exhibitions by interacting with each other and the works.","longdescr":"Every 1st and 3rd Sunday of the month, a WIELS guide takes children and their parents on a ride through one of the exhibitions. Learn to look at the works of art together, to talk about them and to think about them. Enjoy a nice and creative day for the whole family!\r\n\r\nBilingual (FR\/NL)\r\nFree with entry ticket (free for kids)\r\nKids aged between 2 and 12 years old","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wiels.org\/en\/events\/family-funday-22","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/529872.htm