ormal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":140}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[4],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 6-9 ans"],"nl":["Kinderen 6-9 j."],"en":["Children 6-9 yr."]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-09T17:05:06+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-09T16:49:02+02:00","backoffice_id":255685,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.73680629972808},{"id":539183,"date_start":"2022-08-22","date_end":"2022-08-26","date_next":"2022-08-22","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations"}},"others":{"list":[97],"translations":{"fr":["Parc et centre r\u00e9cr\u00e9atifs"],"nl":["Recreatiedomein of centrum"],"en":["Park and recreational centre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La terrasse d'\u00e9t\u00e9 de l'AB","shortdescr":"Ateliers et activit\u00e9s gratuits entre les festivals d'\u00e9t\u00e9 de l'AB !","longdescr":"Du lundi 22 au vendredi 26 ao\u00fbt, la terrasse d'\u00e9t\u00e9 de l'AB est l'endroit id\u00e9al pour profiter d'une ambiance ensoleill\u00e9e, de bonne musique, des souvenirs sympa et d'un programme riche en activit\u00e9s et ateliers amusants. Si vous avez envie de rester apr\u00e8s les concerts de l'apr\u00e8s-midi de Boterhammen in de Stad, vous pouvez vous rendre \u00e0 la terrasse d'\u00e9t\u00e9 de l'AB qui se trouve juste entre la Gare Maritime et le Parc Tour & Taxis (Rue Picard 3, 1000 Bruxelles). Il y a beaucoup \u00e0 faire de 13 heures \u00e0 19 heures, avant le d\u00e9but des concerts gratuits de Fee\u00ebrie\u00ebn. D\u00e9couvrez ici comment acc\u00e9der au site de la Gare Maritime. \r\n\r\n- Lundi: nous vous attendons pour une exp\u00e9rience de r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle tout \u00e0 fait dingue et une initiation aux tricks.\r\n- Mardi: une initiation au funk et au street dance.\r\n- Mercredi: apr\u00e8s le concert de Kapitein Winokio, les enfants auront droit \u00e0 leur propre programme d\u2019animations.\r\n- Jeudi: place aux ateliers de percussions et de cuivres, suivis d\u2019une m\u00e9ga-parade.\r\n- Vendredi: une block party pour terminer la semaine en beaut\u00e9 !","performers":"Organis\u00e9 par l'AB en collaboration avec: Timiss (BrusselDanstDanceBattles), MetX (Zinneke), Darna (DarnaFest) and Bruxelles 2030.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.abconcerts.be\/fr\/projet\/22-2608-ab-zomerterras-terrasse-dete\/a1I5J0000022Y4XUAU","email":"info@abconcerts.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"},"nl":{"name":"AB Zomerterras","shortdescr":"Gratis workshops en activiteiten tussen AB\u2019s zomerfestivals!","longdescr":"Van maandag 22 tot en met vrijdag 26 augustus geniet je op het AB zomerterras van een zonnig sfeertje, goeie muziek, toffe marchandise en een programma vol animatie en workshops. Wie zin heeft om na de middagconcerten van Boterhammen in de Stad nog even te blijven plakken, kan dit jaar terecht op het AB zomerterras dat pal tussen Gare Maritime en Park Tour & Taxis ligt (Picardstraat 3, 1000 Bruxelles). Er valt van alles te beleven van 13u tot 19u, wanneer de gratis Fee\u00ebrie\u00ebn-concerten van start gaan. Hier ontdek je hoe je vlotjes naar Gare Maritime reist. \r\n\r\n- Maandag: kom langs voor een zotte Virtual Reality-ervaring en een Trick-initiatie.  \r\n- Dinsdag: doe mee aan een initatie streetdance en funk.\r\n- Woensdag: kinderanimatie na het gratis middagconcert van Kapitein Winokio. \r\n- Donderdag: percussie- en blazerateliers, gevolgd door een heuse parade.  \r\n- Vrijdag: afsluiten met een block party!","performers":"Georganiseerd door AB in samenwerking met: Timiss (BrusselDanstDanceBattles), MetX (Zinneke), Darna (DarnaFest) en Brussel 2030.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.abconcerts.be\/nl\/project\/22-2608-ab-zomerterras-terrasse-dete\/a1I5J0000022Y4XUAU","email":"info@abconcerts.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"},"en":{"name":"AB's summer terrace","shortdescr":"Free workshops and activities between AB's summer festivals!","longdescr":"From Monday 22 to Friday 26 August, the AB summer terrace is the place to be for a sunny atmosphere, good music, cool souvenirs, and a programme packed with fun activities and workshops. If you feel like sticking around after the afternoon concerts of Boterhammen in de Stad, you can visit the AB summer terrace that lies right between Gare Maritime and Park Tour & Taxis. There is plenty to do from 1 pm to 7 pm, when the free Fee\u00ebrie\u00ebn concerts start. Find out here how to access Gare Maritime.\r\n\r\n- Monday: drop by for a crazy Virtual Reality experience and a Tricks initiation.  \r\n- Tuesday: join an initiation to street dance and funk.  \r\n- Wednesday: fun activities for kids after free afternoon concert by Kapitein Winokio.\r\n- Thursday: time for percussion and brass workshops, followed by a real parade.  \r\n- Friday: a celebration with a block party!","performers":"Organised by AB in collaboration with: Timiss (BrusselDanstDanceBattles), MetX (Zinneke), Darna (DarnaFest) and Brussels 2030.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.abconcerts.be\/en\/project\/22-2608-ab-zomerterras-terrasse-dete\/a1I5J0000022Y4XUAU","email":"info@abconcerts.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"},"de":{"name":"AB Zomerterras","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"},"it":{"name":"AB Zomerterras","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"},"sp":{"name":"AB Zomerterras","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"},"pt":{"name":"AB Zomerterras","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"},"cn":{"name":"AB Zomerterras","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539183"}},"place":{"id":258279,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Gare Maritime : l'ancienne gare de fret devenue jungle urbaine, neutre en \u00e9nergie !\r\n\r\nElle offre le cadre id\u00e9al pour les \u00e9v\u00e9nements culturels innovants, les tournages de films ou s\u00e9ances photo, les march\u00e9s et foires, les lancements et promotions de produits. Les halles de la Gare Maritime ont \u00e9t\u00e9 transform\u00e9es en ville int\u00e9rieure. Elle comportera son propre food hall (\u00e0 partir de septembre 2021), des magasins exclusifs et des bureaux. Dans ce complexe, des espaces uniques et inspirants sont entrecoup\u00e9s de structures en bois chaleureuses. Le b\u00e2timent se pr\u00eate \u00e0 l'organisation de rencontres en petit comit\u00e9 ou de grands happenings. La nef monumentale, attrait architectural, est baign\u00e9e de lumi\u00e8re naturelle indirecte et offre suffisamment d'espace pour les activit\u00e9s int\u00e9rieures bien fr\u00e9quent\u00e9es.\r\nTout \u00e9v\u00e8nement dans la Gare Maritime sera un \u00e9v\u00e8nement \u00e9co-responsable. La durabilit\u00e9 \u00e9tait \u00e0 l'avant-plan pendant les r\u00e9novations du b\u00e2timent. L'\u00e9nergie renouvelable est produite sur place, utilisant la g\u00e9othermie et des panneaux photovolta\u00efques. Sur les promenades vertes bordant la nef centrale, des jardins \u00e0 th\u00e8me et des arbres \u00e0 haut tronc ont \u00e9t\u00e9 amen\u00e9s - comme si le parc voisin se faufile dans le b\u00e2timent. \r\nLa Gare Maritime, un lieu unique : attractif, novateur, ambitieux.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Gare Maritime: van industrieel goederenstation tot energieneutrale urban jungle!\r\n\r\nDe Gare Maritime is de perfecte setting voor innovatieve, culturele evenementen, film- en fotoshoots, markten, beurzen, lanceringen en promoties. De historische stationshallen van de Gare Maritime zijn omgevormd tot overdekte stad, met foodhall (vanaf september 2021), exclusieve winkels en kantoren. Het gebouwencomplex biedt een waaier aan unieke, inspirerende ruimtes afgewisseld met warme houten volumes: perfect voor de organisatie van kleine en grootschalige happenings. D\u00e9 architecturale eyecatcher is de monumentale middenbeuk die baadt in indirect daglicht en over meer dan voldoende ruimte beschikt voor overdekte activiteiten met veel bezoekers.\r\nEen event in de Gare Maritime is een groen event. Tijdens de renovatie van het gebouw was duurzaamheid een speerpunt. Energie wordt ter plaatse hernieuwbaar opgewekt met geothermie en zonnepanelen. De groene wandelboulevards aan weerszijden van de middenbeuk zijn voorzien van thematuinen en hoogstammige bomen, alsof het aangrenzende park het gebouw binnenstroomt. Gare Maritime is een unieke plek: aantrekkelijk, vernieuwend en ambitieus.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Gare Maritime - From industrial freight station to energy neutral urban jungle!\r\n\r\nIt is the perfect setting for innovative cultural events, film or photo shoots, trade shows, fairs, product launches or promotions. \r\nThe historic station concourse that was part of the Gare Maritime has been transformed into an indoor city with its own food hall (coming September 2021), exclusive shops and offices. Countless unique and inspiring areas and warm, wooden structures alternate in this building complex. It is perfectly suited to accommodate both small and major events. The monumental nave is a true architectural eye-catcher, bathed in indirect sunlight and providing ample space for well-attended indoor activities.\r\nAny event in the Gare Maritime is a green event. Sustainability has been key during the renovation works. The building generates its own energy from renewable sources, using geothermics and solar panels. The green boulevards on either side of the nave are lined with themed gardens and tall trees, as if the adjacent park found its way inside. \r\nThe Gare Maritime is a unique place - attractive, innovative and ambitious.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"fr":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"],"en":["Canal"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":18279,"location":{"lat":50.86410665,"lon":4.34464417},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-08-02T15:35:08+02:00","published_at":"2014-05-14T12:03:05+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":107,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 110","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 1979, l\u2019Ancienne Belgique, l\u2019AB pour les intimes, est un lieu exceptionnel de prestations live, toujours en phase avec l\u2019actualit\u00e9 musicale d\u2019ici et de partout ailleurs, tous styles avec une pr\u00e9dominance rock et pop. Les espaces de concert, la Grande Salle avec gradins et galeries, l\u2019AB-Box et le Club, vibrent presque tous les soirs, au propre comme au figur\u00e9.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"Anspachlaan","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Anspachlaan, 110","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 1979 is de Ancienne Belgique, AB voor de kenners, een uitzonderlijke plek om optredens te beleven.  Altijd in overeenstemming met de actualiteit van de muziekscene hier en elders komen alle stijlen aan bod,  met toch een duidelijk overwicht aan rock en pop. De concertruimtes omvatten de  modulaire Grote Zaal met tribune en balkons, de AB-Box en de Club, die bijna elke avond daveren op hun grondvesten, zowel letterlijk als figuurlijk.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"boulevard Anspach, 110","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Ancienne Belgique has been a special place for live performances since 1979. The AB presents contemporary music, especially rock and pop, from all over the world. Besides concerts with internationally famous artists, the AB offers young musicians three stages where they can perform.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 110","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Seit 1970 ist das Ancienne Belgique, AB f\u00fcr Kenner und Freunde, einer der hochkar\u00e4tigsten Konzerts\u00e4le Br\u00fcssels. Mit einer Vorliebe f\u00fcr Rock und Pop finden hier regelm\u00e4\u00dfig rauschende Live-Konzerte statt. In den Konzerts\u00e4le - vom gro\u00dfen Saal mit R\u00e4ngen \u00fcber die AB-Box bis hin zum Club - heizen die gastierenden Gruppen dem Publikum fast t\u00e4glich ein.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"boulevard Anspach, 110","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.abconcerts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 24 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 24 24","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"boulevard Anspach, 110","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Ancienne Belgique ha sido un local \u00fanico de actuaciones en directo desde 1979. Aqu\u00ed podr\u00e1s disfrutar de m\u00fasica actual, especialmente, rock y pop de todo el mundo. Adem\u00e1s de ofrecer conciertos con artistas conocidos a nivel internacional, el AB cuenta con tres escenarios para que los m\u00fasicos j\u00f3venes puedan actuar.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Ancienne Belgique","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"110","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@abconcerts.be","webs