es de la Senne avec Once in Brussels","copyright":"OIB"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-08-23","doors":"18:00:00","start":"18:00:00","end":"19:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":20}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[323],"translations":{"fr":["Gastronomie"],"nl":["Gastronomie"],"en":["Gastronomy"]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-08-05T09:05:10+02:00","published_at":"2022-08-05T08:52:10+02:00","backoffice_id":259350,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":537835,"date_start":"2022-08-24","date_end":"2022-08-24","date_next":"2022-08-24","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":"@ Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale\r\nHide & Seek Festival 2022","longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\n1st Session 6.30pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45f6\r\n2nd Session 8.30pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45f5\r\n\r\nLe b\u00e2timent qui abrite le mus\u00e9e de la Banque nationale de Belgique (BNB) est un joyau architectural nich\u00e9 en plein c\u0153ur de Bruxelles. Ancienne banque coop\u00e9rative (Union du Cr\u00e9dit de Bruxelles), le b\u00e2timent dessin\u00e9 par D\u00e9sir\u00e9 De Keyser a aujourd\u2019hui retrouv\u00e9 un nouvel \u00e9clat et une nouvelle fonction mus\u00e9ale. Mais l\u2019esprit de la banque \u00e0 l\u2019ancienne est toujours l\u00e0 : Salle des guichets, salle des coffres\u2026 Le b\u00e2timent poss\u00e8de \u00e9galement une splendide verri\u00e8re et un escalier majestueux. Vous serez donc log\u00e9s \u00e0 belle enseigne pour accueillir l\u2019ensemble Atine et leur musique persane riche et lumineuse.\r\n\r\nAtine Ensemble est la rencontre in\u00e9dite de quatre musiciennes qui ont donn\u00e9 naissance \u00e0 un corpus de chansons iraniennes r\u00e9-arrang\u00e9es, symbole de l\u2019h\u00e9ritage de leurs trajectoires personnelles et riches de diversit\u00e9. Les quatre musiciennes du groupe arpentent une musique savante et populaire \u00e0 la fois. Le tar, le qanun, la voix et les percussions sont ici r\u00e9unis pour faire r\u00e9sonner la po\u00e9sie persane du 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle mais aussi des compositions in\u00e9dites. Atine veut dire \u00ab r\u00e9unies \u00bb mais aussi \u00ab in\u00e9dit \u00bb. Le projet questionne en filigrane ce qu\u2019est d\u2019\u00eatre persane, et musicienne, au 21i\u00e8me si\u00e8cle.","performers":"A\u00efda Nosrat : violon, voix\r\nSogol Mirzaei : t\u00e2r\r\nChristine Zayed : qan\u00fbn\r\nNiloufar Mohseni : percussions","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/537835.html"},"nl":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":"@ Nationale Bank Museum \r\nHide & Seek Festival 2022","longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\n1st Session 6.30pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45f6\r\n2nd Session 8.30pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45f5\r\n\r\nHet gebouw waarin het museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb (NBB) is ondergebracht is een architecturale parel in hartje Brussel. De Brusselse architect D\u00e9sir\u00e9 De Keyser (1823-1897) ontwierp het in 1872 in opdracht van de Union du Cr\u00e9dit de Bruxelles (UCB). Sinds 2010 heeft een nieuwe glans en een nieuwe museale functie gekregen. Maar de geest van de ouderwetse bank is er nog steeds: de lokettenzaal, de kluisruimtes\u2026 Het gebouw heeft ook een prachtig glazen dak en een majestueuze trap. Kortom, de ideale plek om het Atine-ensemble en hun rijke en heldere Perzische muziek te verwelkomen.\r\n\r\nIn Atine (perzisch voor \u2018samen\u2019, maar ook \u2018onuitgegeven\u2019) verenigt vier muzikantes, A\u00efda Nosrat, Sogol Mirzaei, Christine Zayed, en Niloufar Mohseni, die het rijke Perzische muzikale erfgoed nieuw leven inblazen dankzij hun diversiteit aan invloeden. De Iraanse zangeres en violiste met Azeri-achtergrond, A\u00efda Nosrat, voelt zich even goed thuis in flamenco en jazz als in Iraanse muziek. Sogol Mirzae\u00ef bespeelt de de langhalsluit tar en virtuoze op traditionele muziek, niet zelden aan de zijde van percussioniste Niloufar Mohseni. Het ensemble wordt vervolledig met de Palestijnse muzikante Christine Zayed, die haar opleiding genoot aan het conservatorium van Ramallah en Parijs, en met haar qanun en stem een Arabisch tintje geeft aan het repertoire. Atine geeft op een hedendaagse manier een antwoord op wat het anno 2022 betekent om Perzisch te zijn en muzikant.","performers":"A\u00efda Nosrat : viool, zang\r\nSogol Mirzaei : t\u00e2r\r\nChristine Zayed : qanun\r\nNiloufar Mohseni : percussie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/537835.html"},"en":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":"@ National Bank Museum\r\nHide & Seek Festival 2022","longdescr":null,"performers":"A\u00efda Nosrat : violon, vocals\r\nSogol Mirzaei : t\u00e2r\r\nChristine Zayed : qan\u00fbn\r\nNiloufar Mohseni : percussions","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/537835.html"},"de":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/537835.html"},"it":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/537835.html"},"sp":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/537835.html"},"pt":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/537835.html"},"cn":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Atine Ensemble (Iran)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/537835.html"}},"place":{"id":220155,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 2018, le mus\u00e9e de la Banque nationale de Belgique est install\u00e9 dans un magnifique b\u00e2timent bancaire datant du XIXe si\u00e8cle. \r\n\r\nUn premier circuit dans le mus\u00e9e aborde les r\u00f4les d\u2019une banque centrale \u00e0 travers une sc\u00e9nographie interactive. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son audioguide, le visiteur peut ainsi tant\u00f4t en apprendre un peu plus sur l\u2019\u00e9mission des pi\u00e8ces et des billets, tant\u00f4t tester ses connaissances sur l\u2019euro ou encore \u00eatre amen\u00e9 \u00e0 contr\u00f4ler le niveau d\u2019inflation. \r\n\r\nLe second circuit retrace l\u2019\u00e9volution des moyens de payement et fait la part belle aux collections historiques du mus\u00e9e. Monnaies marchandises, anciens objets de change, anciennes pi\u00e8ces et billets se c\u00f4toient ainsi dans une fresque th\u00e9matique et chronologique qui fera voyager le visiteur dans le temps et \u00e0 travers le monde.\r\n\r\nEnfin, le dernier circuit regroupe une s\u00e9rie d\u2019objets qui d\u00e9montre \u00e0 quel point l\u2019argent est pr\u00e9sent dans notre quotidien.\r\n\r\nLes visites de groupe sont organis\u00e9es \u00e0 partir de 10 personnes - maximum 25. Elles sont gratuites et durent environ 1 heure. Les r\u00e9servations se font via le formulaire en ligne disponible sur le site internet http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/fr\/booking. \r\nRenseignements : 02 221 22 06 \u2013 museum@nbb.be","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Warmoesberg","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Warmoesberg","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 2018 is het museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb in een prachtig 19de-eeuwse bankgebouw ondergebracht.\r\n\r\nAan de hand van interactieve opstellingen focust een eerste parcours in het museum op de taken van een centrale bank. Met behulp van een audiogids kan de bezoeker meer te weten komen over de uitgifte van munten en biljetten, zijn of haar kennis van de euro testen of proberen de inflatie onder controle te houden.\r\nHet tweede parcours schetst de evolutie van de betaalmiddelen en zet hierbij de collecties van het museum in de kijker. Goederengeld, oude ruilmiddelen, munten en biljetten vormen een thematisch en chronologisch geheel, waarbij de bezoeker wordt meegenomen op een reis in de tijd en over heel de wereld.\r\nHet derde parcours tenslotte toont een aantal voorwerpen waarmee wordt aangetoond hoe sterk geld aanwezig is in ons dagelijkse leven.\r\n\r\nGroepsbezoeken kunnen vanaf 10 personen, maximum 25. Ze zijn gratis en duren ongeveer 1 uur. Reserveren graag via de website van het museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl\/booking.\r\nMeer informatie: tel 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Museum of the National Bank of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Since 2018 the museum of the National Bank of Belgium is housed in a splendid 19t century bank building situates at a mere 10-minute walk from the Central Station.\r\n\r\nThe first part of the exhibition pays particular attention to the role and the functions of the National Bank. By use of an audio guide and interactive displays, the visitor will no doubt discover lots of interesting facts about the issue of notes and coins, test their knowledge of the euro, or even try to control the rate of inflation.\r\n\r\nThe second part paints an overall picture of the evolution of money, and showcases many wonderful objects from the museum collection. Commodity money, diverse and peculiar objects once used for bartering, coins and notes... These many various pieces are purposely put in a thematical and chronological context which in the end will provide the visitor with a fascinating overview.\r\n\r\nThe third part of the exhibition proves just how much money is present in our day to day life by displaying a wide range of objects, some everyday and trivial, some quirky.\r\n\r\nGroup visits can be from 10 people up to 25. They are free and take about 1 hour. Please book via the website of the museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/en\/booking.\r\nMore information: 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":592,"location":{"lat":50.84984775,"lon":4.35727802},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-07-07T09:35:07+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:39+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_vi