,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"en":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":"Does your knowledge of Brussels boil down to the Manneken-Pis and Saint-Hubert Galeries? Do you wish to discover other neighbourhoods? Join our \u201cBrussels for Beginners\u201d bike ride!","longdescr":"During this tour, we will drive through the European district and the Cinquantenaire park (stopping at the Berlaymont building) and the beautiful Art Nouveau Squares quarter.\r\n\r\nNext, we continue our route to the city centre through the city\u2019s main park (ederal parliament, royal palace) and its contrasting neighbourhoods, remarkable monuments, and charming squares (Marolles district and the Palais de Justice, the Dansaert and Beguinage districts, ...). An original route, that steers clear from clich\u00e9s!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"de":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"it":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda