:00","backoffice_id":251664,"import_origin":"explore","sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":538336,"date_start":"2022-08-21","date_end":"2022-08-21","date_next":"2022-08-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{"list":[109],"translations":{"fr":["Espaces verts"],"nl":["Groene zones"],"en":["Green spaces"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Con\u00e7u en 1922 comme une \u00abBelgique miniature \u00bb repr\u00e9sentant les divers milieux naturels de notre pays, le jardin \u00e9thologique a, dans les ann\u00e9es 60, \u00e9t\u00e9 libre d\u2019\u00e9voluer vers un splendide marais braban\u00e7on. Ce petit bijou de nature, charg\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et situ\u00e9 \u00e0 deux pas du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre c\u00e9l\u00e8bre ses 100 ans en nous en mettant plein les yeux.\nPhoto : \u00a9visit.brussels","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/538336.html"},"nl":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brusselbabbelt.be","email":"info@brusselbabbelt.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/538336.html"},"en":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brusselschatterguides.be","email":"info@brusselschatterguides.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/538336.html"},"de":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/538336.html"},"it":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/538336.html"},"sp":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/538336.html"},"pt":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/538336.html"},"cn":{"name":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/538336.html"}},"place":{"id":106651,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jardin Jean Massart","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Du nom de son fondateur, le jardin botanique Jean Massart a \u00e9t\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 1922 par ce grand d\u00e9fenseur de la nature et professeur de botanique \u00e0 l\u2019Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles. Il est situ\u00e9 \u00e0 Auderghem, \u00e0 deux pas du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, de la for\u00eat de Soignes et des parcs Seny, Ten Reuken et du Bergoje.\r\n\r\nCe Jardin botanique a \u00e9t\u00e9 dessin\u00e9 par l\u2019architecte paysagiste Jules Buyssens. Avec ses quelque 2000 esp\u00e8ces v\u00e9g\u00e9tales, il est l\u2019un des plus riches jardins botaniques de Belgique et un v\u00e9ritable mus\u00e9e vivant. Admirez-y les milliers de plantes indig\u00e8nes et exotiques dont les jardiniers, chercheurs et \u00e9tudiants prennent soin quotidiennement. Le jardin est en effet un laboratoire en plein air o\u00f9 est \u00e9tudi\u00e9e la fa\u00e7on dont les plantes peuvent rendre les villes plus saines et plus durables. Il est d\u2019ailleurs un mus\u00e9e de l\u2019Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles et fait partie du parcours des sciences, avec notamment le Mus\u00e9um de Zoologie.","description_print":"Cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 1922, le Jardin botanique Jean Massart est g\u00e9r\u00e9 par Bruxelles Environnement en collaboration avec l\u2019Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles.\r\nLe public peut y d\u00e9couvrir un v\u00e9ritable mus\u00e9e vivant de plein air comprenant plus  de 2000 esp\u00e8ces v\u00e9g\u00e9tales dont plusieurs centaines sont \u00e9tiquet\u00e9es.\r\nDestin\u00e9es \u00e0 la recherche, \u00e0 l\u2019enseignement universitaire et \u00e0 la vulgarisation,  les diverses collections qui le composent  se r\u00e9partissent sur 5 hectares en bordure de for\u00eat de Soignes.\r\n\r\nQue peut-on y voir ?\r\n\r\nDans la zone humide, \u00e9tang et marais abritent de nombreuses plantes typiques de notre r\u00e9gion.  \r\nUne collection impressionnante de plantes m\u00e9dicinales permet de rappeler l\u2019importance des plantes en th\u00e9rapeutique. Un verger regroupe d\u2019anciennes vari\u00e9t\u00e9s de pommiers et poiriers. L\u2019arboretum rassemble divers conif\u00e8res et d\u2019autres arbres non indig\u00e8nes.\r\nLes principales familles botaniques de plantes \u00e0 fleurs sont illustr\u00e9es dans le Jardin \u00e9volutif. Une collection de plantes cultiv\u00e9es rassemble plusieurs esp\u00e8ces domestiqu\u00e9es par l\u2019homme ainsi que leurs anc\u00eatres sauvages.\r\nEnfin, les plantes exotiques envahissantes et les plantes m\u00e9tallicoles, deux th\u00e9matiques \u00e9tudi\u00e9es au Laboratoire d\u2019Ecologie v\u00e9g\u00e9tale et Biog\u00e9ochimie, ont \u00e9galement leur parcelle de d\u00e9monstration.\r\n\r\nCe site particuli\u00e8rement riche et diversifi\u00e9 est class\u00e9 depuis 1997. \r\nIl est accessible gratuitement du lundi au vendredi de 9h00 \u00e0 17h00.\r\nDes visites guid\u00e9es sont propos\u00e9es tous les jeudis et 2\u00e8me samedi du mois (de mai \u00e0 fin octobre) ou sur rendez-vous pour les groupes (\u00e9coles, associations\u2026)\r\nhttp:\/\/www.ulb.ac.be\/musees\/jmassart \r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Plantentuin Jean Massart","address_street_name":"Waversesteenweg","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Oudergem","address_line1":"Waversesteenweg, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Oudergem","description_web":"Jean Massart was professor plantkunde aan de Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles. Hij was een fervent natuurliefhebber. In 1922 riep hij de tuin in Oudergem in het leven. De tuin ligt op een steenworp van het Roodklooster, het Zoni\u00ebnwoud en van het Seny-, het Tenreuken- en het Bergojepark.\r\n\r\nHet ontwerp komt van landschapsarchitect Jules Buyssens. Met ongeveer 2.000 plantensoorten is het een van de rijkste botanische tuinen van Belgi\u00eb. Hier waan je je in een levend museum. Elke dag worden de duizenden inheemse en exotische planten verzorgd door tuiniers, onderzoekers en studenten. De tuin is dan ook een openluchtlaboratorium. Hoe kunnen planten steden gezonder en duurzamer maken? Dat s de vraag waarover ze zich hier buigen. De tuin is ook een museum van de Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles en maakt deel uit van het wetenschapsparcours, samen met het Museum voor Dierkunde.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Jardin - Plantentuin Jean Massart","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Named after its founder, the Jean Massart Botanical Garden was created in 1922 by this great defender of nature and professor of botany at the ULB (Free University of Brussels). It's located in Auderghem, a stone's throw from Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, the Sonian Forest and the Seny, Ten Reuken and Bergoje parks.\r\n\r\nThis botanical garden was designed by landscape architect Jules Buyssens. With some 2,000 plant species, it's one of the richest botanical gardens in Belgium and a real living museum. Admire the thousands of native and exotic plants that the gardeners, researchers and students take care of every day. The garden is an open-air laboratory for studying how plants can make cities healthier and more sustainable. It's also a museum of ULB and is part of the science trail, together with the Museum of Zoology.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanischer Garten Jean Massart","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Der Botanische Garten Jean Massart wurde 1922 von dem gro\u00dfen Natursch\u00fctzer und Botanik-Professor an der Freien Universit\u00e4t Br\u00fcssel Jean Massart gegr\u00fcndet. Er befindet sich in Auderghem, ganz in der N\u00e4he der historischen Klosteranlage Rouge-Cl\u00f4itre, dem Soignes-Wald und den Parks Seny, Ten Reuken und Bergoje.\r\n\r\nAngelegt wurde der botanische Garten von dem Landschaftsarchitekten Jules Buyssens. Mit seinen rund 2000 Pflanzenarten z\u00e4hlt er zu den artenreichsten botanischen G\u00e4rten Belgiens. Bewundern k\u00f6nnen Sie sowohl einheimische als auch exotische Pflanzen, die hier von G\u00e4rtnern, Forschern und Studenten gehegt und gepflegt werden, denn der Garten dient als eine Art Freiluftlabor, in dem die positiven Effekte von Pflanzen in der Stadt erforscht wird. Zudem dient er als Museum der Freien Universit\u00e4t Br\u00fcssel und ist Teil des Wissenschaftsparcours, zu dem auch das Zoologische Museum geh\u00f6rt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Jardin botanique Jean Massart (ULB)","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico Jean Massart (ULB)","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Las ex\u00f3ticas colecciones vivientes del jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, creado en 1922 por Jean Massart, fueron creadas para la investigaci\u00f3n, la ense\u00f1anza universitaria y la promoci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica.\r\nPosee casi 2000 especies vegetales localizadas en 5 hect\u00e1reas y divididas en diferentes jardines: el jard\u00edn medicinal y plantas arom\u00e1ticas, el jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico experimental, el jard\u00edn de plantas cultivadas, un huerto, un invernadero y un \u00e1rea experimental. Tambi\u00e9n puedes encontrar dos colecciones asociadas a dos estudios llevados a cabo por la ULB: vegetaci\u00f3n metalofita y plantas invasivas.\r\nTambi\u00e9n hay una \u00e1rea h\u00fameda establecida como reserva natural e inclu\u00edda en la Red Natura 2000.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Jardin botanique Jean Massart","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Jardin botanique Jean Massart","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"1850","address_street_box":null,"email":"jardmass@ulb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ulb.be\/actulb\/dds\/jmassart\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 650 91 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 1850","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":369,"location":{"lat":50.81302327,"lon":4.43829386},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T03:35:38+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:28+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":1491,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Brussel Babbelt","address_street_name":"Thujastraat","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselbabbelt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselbabbelt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermaal-Bosvoorde","address_line1":"Thujastraat, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermaal-Bosvoorde","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels Chatterguides","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselschatterguides.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselschatterguides.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"The Chatterguides : an irresistible invitation to discover and love Brussels!\r\nAccompanied by a Chatterguide, discover the many facets of Brussels: from the Grand Place to Art Nouveau neighborhoods, from chocolate to Belgian beers, from Bruegel to comics, taste all the flavors of the local culture (known as \u00ab belgitude \u00bb).\r\n\r\n-  In Brussels for the first time?  in a few hours, by bus or on foot, we will show you the highlights and let you sample the spirit of the town\r\n- You believe you already know the city? Let us surprise you with our thematic tours and  neighborhoods\u2019 discovery (more than a hundred!)\r\n- Organizing a private or business trip or event? Your groups will love our guided tours, tastings and walking dinners ... and you too because we aim to exceed your expectations and take care of everything !\r\nSince 1983: talkative, experienced and enthusiastic.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":196,"location":{"lat":50.80936777,"lon":4.40413914},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T03:35:38+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:21+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/explore-05df4ae82a15547d0f0ac79be5e7f319eb08f651.jpg","width":1500,"height":1001,"ratio":1.5,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Festival For\u00eat de Soignes - Le Jardin Massart : un ancien jardin botanique rendu \u00e0 la vie sauvage nous raconte son pass\u00e9 glorieux et sa biodiversit\u00e9 d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-08-21","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":0}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[328],"translations":{"fr":["Vert & durable"],"nl":["Groen & duurzaam"],"en":["Green & sustainable"]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T03:35:38+02:00","published_at":"2022-07-14T03:30:31+02:00","backoffice_id":258336,"import_origin":"explore","sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":538152,"date_start":"2022-08-21","date_end":"2022-08-21","date_next":"2022-08-21","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Sara\u00ef Trio (Folk Occitan)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\nSession 6.30pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45is\r\nSession 8.30: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45it\r\n\r\nSport et musique ont beau \u00eatre des univers tr\u00e8s lointains, les combiner produit souvent des \u00e9tincelles. Ambiance vertigineuse et color\u00e9e au programme ! La salle d\u2019escalade New Rock nous accueille pour un concert in\u00e9dit du trio Sara\u00ef et de leur r\u00e9pertoire occitan. Ici on se d\u00e9chausse avant d\u2019entrer, et on s\u2019assied \u00e0 m\u00eame les gros mousses. Un simple regard vers le haut vous portera 20m\u00e8tres plus haut.\r\n\r\nDans un univers qui appelle la montagne, nous avions envie de proposer une exp\u00e9rience folk, roots, acoustique qui se pr\u00eate parfaitement \u00e0 l\u2019acoustique de la salle. Nous avons alors fait appel \u00e0 Sara\u00ef. Le duo Sophie Cavez et Balthazar Montanaro nous garantit depuis dix ans une musique folk po\u00e9tique o\u00f9 improvisation et communication se m\u00e9langent aux influences des traditions musicales belges, fran\u00e7aises et hongroises. Aujourd\u2019hui accompagn\u00e9.es de la chanteuse et percussionniste Juliette Minvielle, ils entament une nouvelle route en trio sous le nom de Sara\u00ef, qui veut dire \u00ab je deviens \u00bb en occitan. Le trio a s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 de magnifiques po\u00e8mes occitans \u00e9crits par des femmes qui \u00e9voquent la f\u00e9minit\u00e9 sous toutes ses formes\u2026 Une anthologie de la chanson d\u2019amour et du quotidien occitan du Moyen \u00c2ge \u00e0 nos jours. Pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 une finesse intemporelle o\u00f9 violon, accord\u00e9on et percussions accompagnent une voix au caract\u00e8re spontan\u00e9 qui fait revivre tout un matrimoine.","performers":"Sophie Cavez : accord\u00e9on diatonique\r\nJuliette Minvielle: voix, percussions\r\nBaltazar Montanaro : violon bariton","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/538152.html"},"nl":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Sara\u00ef Trio (Folk Occitan)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\nSession 6.30pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45is\r\nSession 8.30: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45it\r\n\r\nSport en muziek lijken wel heel verschillende werelden, maar de combinatie ervan levert vaak vonken op. Maak je op voor een duizelingwekkende en kleurrijke combinatie. De klimhal New Rock verwelkomt ons voor een onuitgegeven concert van het Occitaans trio Sara\u00ef. Voor we binnen gaan, doen we onze schoenen aan en begeven ons op de zachte ondergrond van de hoogste klimzaal ter plekke.\r\n\r\nHet duo Sophie Cavez en Baltazar Montanaro staan al tien jaar garant voor po\u00ebtisch folk waarin communicatie en improvisatie samenvloeien met invloeden uit Belgische, Franse en Hongaarse traditionele muziek. Samen met zangeres en percussioniste Juliette Minvielle richtten ze het nieuwe trio Sara\u00ef op, wat \u2018ik word\u2019 betekent in het Occitaans. Dit trio baseert zich op een selectie van Occitaanse gedichten geschreven door vrouwen die gaan over de vrouwelijkheid in al zijn vormen. We krijgen muzikale bloemlezing van Occitaanse liefdesgedichten geschreven door vrouwen, van de middeleeuwen tot heden. Maak je op voor tijdloze finesse waarbij viool, accordeon en percussie een engelenstem begeleiden.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/538152.html"},"en":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Sara\u00ef Trio (Folk Occitan)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\nSession 6.30pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45is\r\nSession 8.30: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45it","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/538152.html"},"de":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Sara\u00ef Trio (Folk Occitan)","shortdescr":null,"long