,"address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Guinguette Fabiola is gelegen in het Koning Boudewijnpark in Jette, op de Wemmelsesteenweg. Op deze levendige plek komen vrienden en families samen voor een drankje terwijl ze van het mooie weer genieten. Door tal van concerten, workshops en andere evenementen valt er in deze Guinguette altijd wat te beleven. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Guinguette Parc du Roi Baudouin - Bar Fabiola","address_street_name":"Parc Roi Baudouin","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/guinguettesbarc.be\/en\/guinguette-fabiola\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 492 50 62 85","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Parc Roi Baudouin","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Pop-up bar Fabiola is located in King Baudouin Park in Jette, on Chauss\u00e9e de Wemmel. It's a lively place where friends and families meet for a drink to celebrate the return of the sun. Between concerts, workshops and other events, no two days are alike at Fabiola. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Guinguette Parc du Roi Baudouin - Bar Fabiola","address_street_name":"Parc Roi Baudouin","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/guinguettesbarc.be\/guinguette-fabiola\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 492 50 62 85","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Parc Roi Baudouin","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Guinguette Parc du Roi Baudouin - Bar Fabiola","address_street_name":"Parc Roi Baudouin","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/guinguettesbarc.be\/guinguette-fabiola\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 49