ce dogs","Accessible parking"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-08-02T15:35:08+02:00","published_at":"2022-08-02T15:21:58+02:00","backoffice_id":259183,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.73680629972808},{"id":533800,"date_start":"2022-08-22","date_end":"2022-08-28","date_next":"2022-08-22","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":"Participe \u00e0 une semaine d'Ateliers de CIRConstance compl\u00e8tement d\u00e9jant\u00e9s.","longdescr":"Danse \u00e0 la verticale, Parkours Acrobatiques & A\u00e9riens, ExplorationS A\u00e9rienneS sur un Trap\u00e8ze, dans un Tissu, sur une Corde, dans un Cerceau\u2026 ParKours, AcrobatieS CircassienneS, au sol, sur des surfaces \u00e9lastiques, sur des objets, au trampoline seul, en duo ou \u00e0 plusieurs..., Jonglerie rythmique, Slackline, Beat Box & Body Percussions, Hip Hop, Musique, Toile de CIRConstance, Jeu(X) de Piste & Histoire(s) de Cirque(s)...\r\n\r\nPr\u00eat \u00e0 relever le d\u00e9fi ? Le challenge sera \u00e0 la fois individuel\u202f[te d\u00e9passer]\u202fmais aussi collectif\u202f[apprendre \u00e0 cr\u00e9er & \u00e0 progresser avec le groupe].\u202fTout cela au service de ton expression & de ta cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9, bien entendu ! \r\n\r\n Les Techniques de Cirque sont autant d'outils au d\u00e9veloppement de la personnalis\u00e9 de chacun.e.s.  \r\n\r\nElles permettent aussi de d\u00e9velopper son capital confiance & relationnel. \r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nUne immersion cirque de 10h00 \u00e0 16h00\r\n\r\nPossibilit\u00e9 de garderie de 9h00 \u00e0 10h00 et de 16h00 \u00e0 17h00 \r\n\r\nLe payement de la garderie se fait sur place, 2\u20ac \/ garderie [ matin ou apr\u00e8s midi ].\r\n\r\nApr\u00e8s l'inscription veuillez envoyer un mail avec le nom, pr\u00e9nom et \u00e2ge de l'enfant \u00e0 l'adresse suivante : secretariat@upupup.be\r\n\r\n*Prix sp\u00e9cial pour les habitants du quartier d'Osseghem 75\u20ac \/ stage + 15\u20ac d'assurance\r\n\r\n [si vous \u00eates concern\u00e9, envoyez un mail \u00e0 l'adresse suivante pour b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier de la r\u00e9duction : secretariat@upupup.be] \r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nPour en savoir plus sur notre approche p\u00e9dagogique qui utilise le Cirque comme passerelle, nous vous invitons \u00e0 lire notre Article :\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/upupup.be\/au-coeur-de-la-pedagogie-la-creativite\/","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/upupup.be\/formation\/formation-stage-ado-stages-saison-2021-2022\/","email":"secretariat@upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 12 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533800.html"},"nl":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533800.html"},"en":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533800.html"},"de":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533800.html"},"it":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533800.html"},"sp":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533800.html"},"pt":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533800.html"},"cn":{"name":"Stage ADOS [+12 ans]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533800.html"}},"place":{"id":226740,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"L'Espace Catastrophe, Centre International de Cr\u00e9ation des Arts du Cirque, est un projet culturel pluriel et multifacette enti\u00e8rement d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux pratiques circassiennes contemporaines.\r\nIniti\u00e9 en 1995, l'Espace Catastrophe est devenu, au fil des ann\u00e9es, un moteur de d\u00e9veloppement du Cirque contemporain \u00e0 Bruxelles et en Belgique, dont le rayonnement d\u00e9passe largement les fronti\u00e8res de notre pays.\r\nLe centre encourage un cirque de cr\u00e9ation, inventif, diversifi\u00e9, ouvert sur de multiples disciplines, tout en cr\u00e9ant des passerelles entre elles, favorisant les rencontres interculturelles, interdisciplinaire et interg\u00e9n\u00e9rationnelles.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Osseghemstraat","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Osseghemstraat, 50","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"Espace Catastrophe is een cultureel project gewijd aan de ontwikkeling van \r\nhedendaagse inventieve circuscreaties. Door de jaren heen een ware stuwende kracht geworden, reikt de invloed van het centrum tot ver buiten de grenzen van ons land. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Espace Catastrophe is a cultural project devoted to the development of\r\ncontemporary, inventive circus creations. Over the years the center has become a true driving force, and its influence extends beyond the limits of our country.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_