idth":1500,"height":1001,"ratio":1.5,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Le square Fr\u00e8re-Orban","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Le square Fr\u00e8re-Orban","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Le square Fr\u00e8re-Orban","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-08-25","doors":null,"start":"18:00:00","end":"19:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":0},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-07-27T12:05:41+02:00","published_at":"2022-04-08T03:30:15+02:00","backoffice_id":250994,"import_origin":"explore","sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":537968,"date_start":"2022-08-25","date_end":"2022-08-25","date_next":"2022-08-25","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Septeto Santiaguero (Cuba)","shortdescr":"@Imprimerie de la Banque Nationale","longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\nSession 7pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45gi\r\nSession 9pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45gj\r\n\r\nIl fut une p\u00e9riode o\u00f9 les billets de banque \u00e9taient imprim\u00e9s par milliers dans le centre de Bruxelles, entre la cath\u00e9drale et la tour des finances. Cette p\u00e9riode n\u2019est pas si lointaine mais l\u2019ancienne imprimerie de la banque nationale a d\u00e9j\u00e0 eu le temps de tomber aux oubliettes, ou presque. Les lieux ont gard\u00e9 tout leur aspect technique, et nous sommes ravis d\u2019avoir l\u2019occasion d\u2019y organiser un double concert de l\u2019un des groupes les plus mythiques du son cubano : Le Septeto Santiaguero.\r\n\r\nOriginaires de la tr\u00e8s festive ville de Santigo de Cuba, connue pour son carnaval annuel, le groupe Septeto Santiaguero r\u00e9unis certains des plus ardents d\u00e9fenseurs du Son \u00e0 travers le monde. Popularis\u00e9 par le Buena Vista Social Club, ce genre traditionnel de l\u2019\u00eele rouge s\u00e9duit largement et connait toujours un succ\u00e8s croissant. Le Septeto Santiaguero excelle dans diff\u00e9rents ge,nres de la musique traditionnelle cubaine et propose un large \u00e9ventail de rythmes chaloup\u00e9s comme le Guaracha, le Bolero, le Trova traditionel, le Danz\u00f3n, le Chang\u00fc\u00ed et le Pil\u00f3n. Mais la sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 du groupe est r\u00e9solument son interpr\u00e9tation fra\u00eeche et inspir\u00e9e du son cubain, qu\u2019ils m\u00e9langent parfois m\u00eame avec de la cumbia. La musique du septet est r\u00e9solument dansante, ex\u00e9cut\u00e9e par d\u2019excellents musiciens et transmet une \u00e9nergie sans failles, positive et festive.\r\n\r\nTickets en vente \u00e0 partir du mardi 12 juillet \u00e0 10h30!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/537968.html"},"nl":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Septeto Santiaguero (Cuba)","shortdescr":"@Drukkerij van de Nationale Bank","longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\nSession 7pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45gi\r\nSession 9pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45gj\r\n\r\nOoit werden de bankbiljetten bij duizenden gedrukt in het centrum van Brussel, tussen de kathedraal en de financi\u00ebntoren. Al is het nog niet zo lang geleden, toch is de voormalige drukkerij van de Nationale Bank in het historische gebouw van architect Marcel Van Goethem al bijna in de vergetelheid geraakt. De gebouwen hebben voorlopig al hun technische aspecten behouden en we zijn verheugd er een dubbelconcert te organiseren met \u00e9\u00e9n van de meest legendarische groepen van Cubaanse son: het Septeto Santiaguero.\r\nDe musici van het Cubaanse ensemble komen uit Santiago, de bakermat van de son. Deze traditionele Cubaanse stijl leefde op dankzij de heren van Buena Vista Social Club. Septeto Santiaguero houdt het genre levend en in plaats van grijsgedraaide klassiekers brengt de groep het publiek in beroering met een sterk eigen geluid en grotendeels eigen composities. Dat leverde hen twee Grammy Awards en meerdere nominaties op. De groep grossiert als vanouds in de verschillende genres van de traditionale muziek met Son, Guaracha, Bolero, traditionele Trova, Danz\u00f3n, Chang\u00fc\u00ed en Pil\u00f3n, maar combineert ook son met cumbia. Dit wordt ongetwijfeld een topavond.\r\n\r\nTickets te koop vanaf dinsdag 12 juli om 10u30!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/537968.html"},"en":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Septeto Santiaguero (Cuba)","shortdescr":"@National Bank former printing factory","longdescr":"Hide & Seek Festival, traditional world music in unexpected places in Brussels: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45et\r\n\r\nSession 7pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45gi\r\nSession 9pm: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-45gj\r\n\r\nThere was a time when bank notes were printed, by the thousands, in the center of Brussels, between the Cathedral and the Finance Tower. This was not so long ago, but the old National Bank printing-house has been practically forgotten. The printing-house space still exhibits its old technical aspect. We\u2019re delighted to be able to organize, in this venue, a double concert by one of the most mythical Cuban ensembles: the Septeto Santiaguero.\r\n\r\nSantiago de Cuba natives, the Septeto Santiaguero musicians, true to their renowned festive city, defend their island\u2019s sound around the world. Popularized by the Buena Vista Social Club, this musical genre continues to captivate an ever-growing public. The Septeto Santiaguero excels in the different traditional Cuban musical varieties. It proposes a large range of swinging rhythms, such as the Guaracha, the Bolero, the traditional Trova, the Danz\u00f3n, the Chang\u00fc\u00ed and the Pil\u00f3n. However, the group\u2019s specialty remains its fresh and inspired interpretation of the Cuban sound, to which they sometimes give a Cumbia twist. Theirs is definitely a dancing music, brought about by excellent musicians, transmitting a positive, festive energy.\r\n\r\nTickets on sale from Tuesday 12 July at 10.30 am!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/537968.html"},"de":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Septeto Santiaguero (Cuba)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/537968.html"},"it":{"name":"Hide & Seek 2022: Septeto Santiaguero (Cuba)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking"