c, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","es"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Nikanor","shortdescr":"On va se d\u00e9hancher avec Nikanor, une musique aux sonorit\u00e9s latino, une ambiance festive au rayon Vert !","longdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir comment ces artistes ont r\u00e9ussi \u00e0 red\u00e9finir la vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de la tradition musicale p\u00e9ruvienne et latino-am\u00e9ricaine dans les nouveaux contextes urbains. Sur base de la \u00ab Chicha \u00bb ( style de musique tropicale des Andes tr\u00e8s populaire dans les ann\u00e9es 80) NIKANOR red\u00e9couvre les ingr\u00e9dients qui ont rendu possible cette fusion de rythmes, couleurs et m\u00e9lodies qu\u2019ont cr\u00e9\u00e9e les migrants.","performers":"Sergio Carvajal Del Salto; Marx Sanchez; Alfredo Quelopana; Carlos Rios ; Ma\u00f1e Narv\u00e1ez","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lerayonvert.be\/","email":"lerayonvert@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 498 63 75 97","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"},"nl":{"name":"Nikanor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"},"en":{"name":"Nikanor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"},"de":{"name":"Concert : Nikanor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"},"it":{"name":"Concert : Nikanor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"},"sp":{"name":"Concert : Nikanor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"},"pt":{"name":"Concert : Nikanor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"},"cn":{"name":"Concert : Nikanor","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539164"}},"place":{"id":244578,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Le Rayon Vert","address_street_name":"Rue Gustave Van Huynegem","address_street_number":"32","address_street_box":null,"email":"lerayonvert@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lerayonvert.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 498 63 75 97","phone_booking":"+32 498 63 75 97","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Rue Gustave Van Huynegem, 32","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Dans les entrep\u00f4ts de l'ancienne brasserie Taymans se trouve Le Rayon Vert, un lieu incontournable pour les Jettois qui appr\u00e9cient l'atmosph\u00e8re villageoise du Jette village. Depuis 2006, une \u00e9quipe motiv\u00e9e organise de nombreuses activit\u00e9s socio-culturelles et durables dans cet espace de culture et de rencontre : concerts, pi\u00e8ces de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, conf\u00e9rences, expositions, cin\u00e9-concerts, cabaret, d\u00e9gustations, ateliers, etc. Vous pouvez payer avec la Zinne, la monnaie locale de Bruxelles. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Rayon Vert","address_street_name":"Gustave Van Huynegemstraat","address_street_number":"32","address_street_box":null,"email":"lerayonvert@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lerayonvert.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 498 63 75 97","phone_booking":"+32 498 63 75 97","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Gustave Van Huynegemstraat, 32","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"In de pakhuizen van de oude Taymansbrouwerij ligt Le Rayon Vert, een hotspot voor tal van Jettenaren die houden van de dorpse sfeer van de Jette village. Sinds 2006 organiseert een gemotiveerd team tal van sociaal-culturele en duurzame activiteiten in deze cultuur- en ontmoetingsruimte: concerten, theaterstukken, conferenties, tentoonstellingen, cineconcerten, cabaret, degustaties, workshops, enz. Je kan er betalen met de Zinne, de lokale Brusselse munt. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Rayon Vert","address_street_name":"Rue Gustave Van Huynegem","address_street_number":"32","address_street_box":null,"email":"lerayonvert@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lerayonvert.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 498 63 75 97","phone_booking":"+32 498 63 75 97","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Rue Gustave Van Huynegem, 32","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Le Rayon Vert","address_street_name":"Rue Gustave Van Huynegem","address_street_number":"32","address_street_box":null,"email":"lerayonvert@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lerayonvert.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 498 63 75 97","phone_booking":"+32 498 63 75 97","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Rue Gustave Van Huynegem, 32","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Le Rayon Vert","address_street_name