seront pr\u00e9sents tout le weekend et tiendront un stand \u00e0 l\u2019image de leurs diff\u00e9rentes cuv\u00e9es. Les participants pourront \u00e0 l\u2019aide de jetons aller go\u00fbter aux diff\u00e9rents cidres. \r\n\u2028\u2028\r\nBBQ\u2028\r\nLe festival s\u2019adresse \u00e0 tous les \u00e9picuriens. Pour accompagner les cidres, nous organisons des barbecues en partenariat avec certains chefs et restaurants reconnus de la capitale.\r\n\r\nMUSIQUE\r\nLa musique joue un r\u00f4le important dans le festival. Le samedi sera d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux dj set variant du rock, hip-hop et musique \u00e9lectronique. Le dimanche accueillera de la musique live avec trois concerts.  \u2028\u2028","performers":"1785 Cider \r\nToubon\r\nCidrerie du Condroz\r\nHoppug\r\nCidrerie des Croisers\r\nAntoine Marois\r\nCidrerie du Leguer\r\nFruitdas\r\nGazenhof\r\nLes terres de Crompechine\r\nDruug \r\nFerme du Vastel (Cotentin)\r\nDe Merderie\r\nAtelier Constant Berger\r\nPomesk \r\nTerre en vue\r\nVelt\r\nArbres\r\nDiversifruit \/ Wal4fruits\r\nB\u00fb\u00fbmplanters\r\nLazy Sin \r\nJohnny Cadillac \r\nTuff Guac","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.see-u.brussels\/","email":"garyschwarts@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 38 50 15","phone_booking":"+32 473 60 71 13","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/539110.html"},"nl":{"name":"Pom pom pom","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"garyschwarts@hotmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/539110.html"},"en":{"name":"Pom pom pom","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"garyschwarts@hotmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/539110.html"},"de":{"name":"Pom pom pom","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"e