 promenades, des visites d\u2019int\u00e9rieurs, des conf\u00e9rences et des visites guid\u00e9es dans des expositions, des mus\u00e9es et des ateliers d\u2019artistes. Ils jettent un coup d\u2019\u0153il dans les coulisses d\u2019une surprenante Bruxelles et partent \u00e0 la recherche de r\u00e9cits fascinants d\u2019hier, d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui et de demain ! Korei soul\u00e8ve le voile sur l\u2019architecture, la croissance urbaine, les mentalit\u00e9s, l\u2019art et le design. Langues : Fran\u00e7ais-N\u00e9erlandais- Anglais- Allemand\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Korei Guided Tours","address_street_name":"Zaterdagplein","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@korei.be","website":"http:\/\/www.korei.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 380 22 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zaterdagplein, 6","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Korei Guided Tours\u2026Brussel achter de schermen! Korei Guided Tours organiseert al meer dan 25 jaar wandelingen, interieurbezoeken, lezingen en rondleidingen in tentoonstellingen, musea en artiestenateliers. Ze kijken achter de coulissen van verrassend Brussel en gaan op zoek naar boeiende verhalen van vandaag, morgen en gisteren! Korei ontdekt architectuur, stadsgroei, denkgewoontes, kunst en design.                                               Talen: Nederlands-Frans-Engels-Duits \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Korei Guided Tours","address_street_name":"Place du Samedi Zaterdagplein","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@korei.be","website":"http:\/\/www.korei.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 380 22 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Samedi Zaterdagplein, 6","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Korei Guided Tours...Brussels behind the scenes! For more than 25 years, Korei Guided Tours has been organising walks, interior visits, lectures and guided tours of exhibitions, museums and artists' studios. They take a look behind the scenes of a surprising Brussels and go in search of fascinating stories of yesterday, today and tomorrow! Korei lifts the veil on architecture, urban growth, mentalities, art and design. Languages: French - Dutch - English - German","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Korei","address_street_name":"Place du Samedi","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@korei.be","website":"http:\/\/www.korei.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 380 22 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Samedi, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Korei","address_street_name":"Place du Samedi","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@korei.be","website":"http:\/\/www.korei.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 380 22 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Samedi, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Korei","address_street_name":"Place du Samedi","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@korei.be","website":"http:\/\/www.korei.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 380 22 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Samedi, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Korei","address_street_name":"Place du Samedi","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null