1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent, 21","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":"Le Mus\u00e9e bruxellois du Moulin et de l'Alimentation est situ\u00e9 dans l'ancien moulin d'Evere. T\u00e9moin unique du patrimoine industriel bruxellois, ce b\u00e2timent class\u00e9 a suivi toutes les \u00e9volutions techniques des XIXe et XXe si\u00e8cles. Les collections permanentes illustrent le monde de la meunerie et l\u2019histoire du moulin d\u2019Evere. Chaque ann\u00e9e, en septembre, le renouvellement complet des objets expos\u00e9s permet d'approfondir une th\u00e9matique alimentaire diff\u00e9rente.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Museum van de Molen en de Voeding","address_street_name":"Windmolenstraat","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"mbma-bmmv@evere.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.molenevere.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 37 79","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Windmolenstraat, 21","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":"Het Brussels Museum van de Molen en de Voeding is gelegen in de oude molen van Evere. Als unieke getuige van het industrieel erfgoed van Brussel, heeft dit beschermde monumentale gebouw alle technische ontwikkelingen van de negentiende en twintigste eeuw gekend. De permanente collecties illustreren de wereld en de geschiedenis van de molen van Evere. Elk jaar in september wordt de selectie van tentoongestelde voorwerpen compleet vernieuwd wat toelaat zich telkens opnieuw in een nieuw voedingsthema te verdiepen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels Museum of the Mill and Food","address_street_name":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"mbma-bmmv@evere.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.moulindevere.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 37 79","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent, 21","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":"Based in a former windmill, the Brussels Museum of the Mill and Food is located in an extensive island of greenery. Since its opening in 2008, the museum has explored numerous topics related to food in temporary exhibitions.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Bruxellois du Moulin et de l'Alimentation","address_street_name":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"mbma-bmmv@evere.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.moulindevere.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 37 79","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent, 21","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler Museum der M\u00fchle und der Ern\u00e4hrung ist in der alten M\u00fchle von Evere untergebracht. Als architektonisches Zeugnis des Br\u00fcsseler Industrieerbes hat die M\u00fchle s\u00e4mtliche technische Entwicklungen des 19. und 20. Jahrhunderts durchlaufen. Die Ausstellungen zeigen die Welt der M\u00fcllerei und die Geschichte der M\u00fchle von Evere. Jedes Jahre im September werden die Exponate ausgetauscht, so dass immer wieder neue Themen im Zusammenhang mit der Ern\u00e4hrung vertieft werden k\u00f6nnen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Bruxellois du Moulin et de l'Alimentation","address_street_name":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"mbma-bmmv@evere.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.moulindevere.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 37 79","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent, 21","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":"","descriptio